[{"id":73476,"title":"重生后我成了皇叔的心尖宠","category":"古装仙侠","pic":"https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20240409-1/15bff75ae7d860999aeb258e8b805e1d.webp","year":"2023","area":"内地","actor":"","director":"","content":"<p>前世大婚前日他下旨害的她家破人亡，還害死他們的孩子，她含恨跳下城牆，重活一世，她竟嫁給了那個人人趨之若避的嗜血殺神皇叔，沒想到那看似冰冷的皇叔竟把她寵上了天！</p>","episodes":[{"name":"1-20集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202311/21/xrbYXPbm5U2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"21-40集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202311/21/qGWExwEkbT2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"41-60集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202311/21/j1GcqqgT2u2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"61-80集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202311/21/b1kzA6nBeW2/video/index.m3u8"}],"data_file":"cat_3f373f3146_part45.json"},{"id":72908,"title":"三滴血","category":"古装仙侠","pic":"https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20260712-1/449f8cfe809a23620afb8bbec08d3cd7.jpg","year":"1960","area":"中国大陆","actor":"刘毓中,陈妙华,樊新民,肖若兰,孟遏云,全巧民,雷震中,伍敏中","director":"孙敬,郭阳庭","content":"<p>周人瑞是山西五台县人，在陕西韩城县经商。其妻在生下一对孪生儿子后死去。周人瑞无力抚养，便请邻居王妈妈将次子卖给李三娘为嗣，取名李遇春。留下长子托王妈妈乳育，取名周天佑。周人瑞因生意倒闭，携天佑回乡。周人瑞的弟弟周人祥夫妇为独霸家产，不认天佑是周人瑞的亲子，涉讼公堂。县令晋信书偏是一个死啃书本的腐儒，见汝南先贤传有“陈业滴血认亲”的记载，便用此法断案。见周人瑞父子滴血入水不融，即错断其并非骨肉，勒令押解天佑出境自行归宗。遇春在李三娘的抚养下长大成人，与李三娘亲生女儿晚春姐弟相称，感情甚为融洽。李三娘有意要遇春继承门户，与王妈妈商定，假称女儿晚春是自己的养女，欲与遇春婚配，但尚未成婚，李三娘病逝。土豪阮自用垂涎晚春已久，捏造庚帖，借吊唁之机，前来诈婚，挑起讼端。晋信书来审此案。晋信书仍用滴血认亲之法，见二人血液融合，误断二人乃一母同胞不能成婚，将晚春判与...</p>","episodes":[{"name":"HD","url":"https://v8.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv8/202312/02/H0BtNtdLCh1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"全集","url":"https://v6.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv6/202607/11/ZCz5w9whgy89/video/index.m3u8"}],"data_file":"cat_3f373f3146_part45.json"},{"id":72507,"title":"仙尊师傅太诱人","category":"古装仙侠","pic":"https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20240409-1/bd81afae5c740117a69ddb759011537b.jpg","year":"2023","area":"内地","actor":"","director":"","content":"<p>喜欢一个人的我有什么錯？即使他是我的师尊！这天道不公，那我便放弃修为十世为人！我在人间逍遙快活过上自己喜欢的生活，可偏偏师尊要在我这最后一世下凡來助我修仙？</p>","episodes":[{"name":"1-20集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202312/09/AeHQbDdGmg2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"21-40集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202312/09/fWwpkwYQJW2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"41-60集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202312/09/havLq33cMQ2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"61-80集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202312/09/gaAcPq6d7b2/video/index.m3u8"}],"data_file":"cat_3f373f3146_part45.json"},{"id":67730,"title":"间谍夫妇今天又又又撞任务了","category":"古装仙侠","pic":"https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20240409-1/400b77827922deb1486f06b6db27e547.jpg","year":"2023","area":"内地","actor":"","director":"","content":"<p>古代版“史密斯夫妇”《间谍夫妇今天又又又撞任务了》 结婚前夕都要出任务，这不巧了么！</p>","episodes":[{"name":"1-15集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202401/24/sP5dJL8j9d2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"16-33集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202401/24/JeYYAkqkdZ2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"34-51集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202401/24/xe9SJhV8PJ2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"52-69集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202401/24/d9mv15RtEi2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"70-91集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202401/24/HkvXCQgCWn2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"92-106集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202401/24/MgDYFNLFEe2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"107-118集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202401/24/y16Fax8yD72/video/index.m3u8"}],"data_file":"cat_3f373f3146_part45.json"},{"id":67644,"title":"钱金金的驭夫之路","category":"古装仙侠","pic":"https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20240409-1/91ad0725697db8b04d9995766e1de2c4.jpg","year":"2023","area":"内地","actor":"","director":"","content":"<p>男人被家里卖给商贾之女，为反抗命运寻找命定之人逃跑，沒想到偶然遇到的命定之人竟然就是她？ ！</p>","episodes":[{"name":"1-19集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202401/25/ETsxYuXuVY2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"20-40集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202401/25/p86rfJCZdp2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"41-61集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202401/25/PRWrnzetkf2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"62-79集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202401/25/CJb0DqbPCz2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"80-99集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202401/25/x3r1cJ80zS2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"100-114集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202401/25/yJb2hyu3Qr2/video/index.m3u8"}],"data_file":"cat_3f373f3146_part45.json"},{"id":65909,"title":"进击的小辰子","category":"古装仙侠","pic":"https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20240409-1/11478191620cbef2b764851ca1077000.jpg","year":"2023","area":"内地","actor":"","director":"","content":"","episodes":[{"name":"1-20集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202402/27/vmvZRDQrLD2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"21-40集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202402/27/kbGCL0uCav2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"41-60集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202402/27/8X5wm0rR9z2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"61-80集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202402/27/UuxjwSSDh12/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"81-90集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202402/27/9Q2SxSXw7R2/video/index.m3u8"}],"data_file":"cat_3f373f3146_part45.json"},{"id":65786,"title":"铜雀春深美人谋","category":"古装仙侠","pic":"https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20240409-1/f95ed3038fa38b1d00e5ca5e46e02081.jpg","year":"2023","area":"内地","actor":"","director":"","content":"<p>赵芙身负血海深仇，当年父亲冒天下之大不韪，弹劾容妃惑国，竟使得赵家满门被灭！唯有自已因妖妃一时心软，而幸免于难！如此深仇大恨怎能不报，于是化名谢家千金，进宫选秀，势必血债血偿</p>","episodes":[{"name":"1-20集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202402/29/LfAU9N2bgp2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"21-40集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202402/29/2qkdT4JL2q2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"41-60集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202402/29/qD45qkU8YR2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"61-80集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202402/29/pqvcHc0cbD2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"81-100集","url":"https://v3.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv3/202402/29/M46f8HvSi22/video/index.m3u8"}],"data_file":"cat_3f373f3146_part45.json"},{"id":65083,"title":"不好啦，王妃又发飙了","category":"古装仙侠","pic":"https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20240409-1/9865c7943f95c6d95a7f9e160ab0046c.jpg","year":"2023","area":"内地","actor":"","director":"","content":"<p>唐诗因前世错爱他人,不仅害得自己家破人亡,还害了一直爱她的宋辞,一朝重生回到与宋辞成亲当天,她发誓这一世不再辜负他。</p>","episodes":[{"name":"1-20集","url":"https://v10.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv10/202403/11/aCU2bxpsqX2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"21-40集","url":"https://v10.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv10/202403/11/80uU7kykdp2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"41-60集","url":"https://v10.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv10/202403/11/mric63Mcd02/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"61-80集","url":"https://v10.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv10/202403/11/riRPKeRcFf2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"81-100集","url":"https://v10.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv10/202403/11/0wxtkPQUYz2/video/index.m3u8"}],"data_file":"cat_3f373f3146_part45.json"},{"id":64556,"title":"落花时节又逢君短剧","category":"古装仙侠","pic":"https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20240409-1/5e57e655293b1a2d5a1befb084b19ead.jpg","year":"2024","area":"内地","actor":"","director":"","content":"<p>天下第一女商贾VS权倾朝野疯狂批权臣重生一世取代一切让爱情之人都悔恨</p>","episodes":[{"name":"1-20集","url":"https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/19/Kmc5FhjVB92/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"21-40集","url":"https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/19/PDyR8vuwrr2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"41-60集","url":"https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/19/6YCyfRYGMR2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"61-80集","url":"https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/19/bk0SjKw7rN2/video/index.m3u8"}],"data_file":"cat_3f373f3146_part45.json"},{"id":64398,"title":"重生王妃是首富","category":"古装仙侠","pic":"https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20240409-1/fa5c48102fb06bdc5fb367468dafb357.jpg","year":"2024","area":"内地","actor":"","director":"","content":"","episodes":[{"name":"1-20集","url":"https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/21/ahb99Zaqxt2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"21-40集","url":"https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/21/eGwrf8VQr22/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"41-60集","url":"https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/21/7nG8vYNfT52/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"61-80集","url":"https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/21/Lfdgr9PWDH2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"81-100集","url":"https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/21/GTVE32GMZv2/video/index.m3u8"}],"data_file":"cat_3f373f3146_part45.json"},{"id":64396,"title":"医见钟情，奈何陛下偏要宠我","category":"古装仙侠","pic":"https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20240409-1/13218ff7d711de97b6e042865fb1d1f1.jpg","year":"2024","area":"内地","actor":"","director":"","content":"<p>神医嫡女被人计竟和外星人男子风流一夜，还没等她反应过来就被赐婚成了皇后？！ 但婚前她却有点喜欢上了那个男人，万般撒算泼就是退不了婚，怎奈他竟是陛下？！</p>","episodes":[{"name":"1-20集","url":"https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/21/4KnFwgCsxZ2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"21-40集","url":"https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/21/2EnLvwqfzb2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"41-60集","url":"https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/21/T14an5pX2G2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"61-80集","url":"https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/21/95s0knXwfV2/video/index.m3u8"}],"data_file":"cat_3f373f3146_part45.json"},{"id":63990,"title":"玉生烟","category":"古装仙侠","pic":"https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20240409-1/fdd5857984712ca5dba265d78e375e0a.jpg","year":"2024","area":"内地","actor":"","director":"","content":"<p>上壹世我惨忍侍女联合夫君爱情，连了整个皇宫！最爱我累的人也不幸遇难，来世我必将寻他复仇！无意于我竟意外重生，这次我要新仇旧账壹起算，守护我珍视之人</p>","episodes":[{"name":"1-20集","url":"https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/26/ZmgzRmzJFP2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"21-40集","url":"https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/26/8zVBjhYrDa2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"41-60集","url":"https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/26/Mupyh92Nti2/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"61-80集","url":"https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/26/CFVEDRfBG72/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"81-100集","url":"https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202403/26/rjG6WLgqAw2/video/index.m3u8"}],"data_file":"cat_3f373f3146_part45.json"},{"id":58982,"title":"黑莲花质子攻略手册","category":"古装仙侠","pic":"https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20231225-1/a259bce161e64020c20396d3ae63b062.webp","year":"2023","area":"中国大陆","actor":"","director":"","content":"","episodes":[{"name":"全集","url":"https://v1.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv1/202404/15/AF1mtsHaYi85/video/index.m3u8"}],"data_file":"cat_3f373f3146_part45.json"},{"id":5366,"title":"玉罗刹","category":"古装仙侠","pic":"https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20260505-1/cdcbe8d821964fe05ee2d522178c300f.jpg","year":"1968","area":"中国香港","actor":"郑佩佩,谷峰,唐菁,樊梅生","director":"何梦华","content":"<p>每当夜晚有女人的歌声响起，就意味着有人被杀，第二天就会有许多人头挂在街上。杀人者叫“玉罗刹”，专杀姓阎的人。客栈里，侠客徐英豪要去找仇人石勇山报杀父之仇，偶遇化名冷秋寒的玉罗刹，徐英豪问他为何杀尽阎家人，玉罗刹回答说：阎家兄弟20人中不知是谁杀了我的全家，但总有一个是。二人分手后，徐英豪来到石家庄，一醉汉自称石勇山，徐英豪举斧就砍，醉汉当场毙命，众乡亲闻声赶来，告诉英豪杀错人了，真正的石勇山早已搬走，英豪发誓从此封剑。</p>","episodes":[{"name":"HD","url":"https://v5.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv5/202404/20/ZqmLBJ8j9x77/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"全集","url":"https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202605/05/c9aBz49G1G91/video/index.m3u8"}],"data_file":"cat_3f373f3146_part45.json"},{"id":1230,"title":"荡寇风云","category":"古装仙侠","pic":"https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20261112-1/fd60b924c59d355bf1b5f3a4f6e1ed73.jpg","year":"2017","area":"中国大陆","actor":"赵文卓,洪金宝,万茜","director":"陈嘉上","content":"<p>影片讲述了一代名将戚继光南征倭寇还沿海太平的传奇故事，明中期嘉靖年间，地方官府腐败、明兵军心不整，倭寇趁虚而入，屡次进犯东南沿海。正值内忧外患之际，戚继光（赵文卓 饰）临危受命，与俞大猷（洪金宝 饰）自行招募三千义乌村民，在短短数日之内，以严明军纪、非常手段操练新兵，以先进武器 、精绝阵法武装部队，成为史上首支“特种部队”、闻名中外的“戚家军”。</p>","episodes":[{"name":"HD","url":"https://v6.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv6/202311/14/NRwGHpN3XJ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"全集","url":"https://v11.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv11/202611/12/cutw3PAfSm96/video/index.m3u8"}],"data_file":"cat_3f373f3146_part45.json"},{"id":764,"title":"香蜜沉沉烬如霜","category":"古装仙侠","pic":"https://img1.wujinwszy.vip/upload/vod/20260615-1/0e41c2e71b33edcb7c98d0d615146b2a.webp","year":"2018","area":"内地","actor":" 杨紫 / 邓伦 / 陈钰琪 / 罗云熙 / 王一菲","director":" 朱锐斌 / 李秉光 / 澄丰","content":"","episodes":[{"name":"全集","url":"https://v9.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv9/202606/14/c977rRevDD86/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v4.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv4/202309/04/sWbXL8uwU51/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v4.wujinwsym3u8.com/wjv4/202308/27/BxdTkHRfZj1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https:/